WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.834 --> 00:00:20.495
Ben gazed around, hoping that Winnie had seen Team Black's first victory.

2
00:00:21.296 --> 00:00:25.057
To his surprise, she was hurrying toward him with a worried look.

3
00:00:25.077 --> 00:00:29.279
"Ben! Can I talk to you for a minute?"

4
00:00:29.999 --> 00:00:30.720
Ben gulped.

5
00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:34.053
What did she want to talk to him about?

6
00:00:34.793 --> 00:00:36.333
His eyes flicked to Zork.

7
00:00:38.234 --> 00:00:39.814
Serena rushed toward him too.

8
00:00:39.834 --> 00:00:43.475
"Actually, we need to talk to you."

9
00:00:44.556 --> 00:00:47.117
She pointed toward a quiet spot under a tree.

10
00:00:47.137 --> 00:00:48.997
"Over there."

11
00:00:50.818 --> 00:00:52.318
Ben followed the witches.

12
00:00:53.718 --> 00:00:56.319
He was so nervous, he thought he'd explode.

13
00:00:56.339 --> 00:00:58.460
"Winnie, what's up?"

14
00:01:00.608 --> 00:01:02.549
"We think Team Orange may be cheating!"

15
00:01:02.569 --> 00:01:06.930
"Whew!" Ben blew out a sigh of relief.

16
00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:08.431
"Is that all?"

17
00:01:09.651 --> 00:01:11.192
Winnie blinked in surprise.

18
00:01:11.212 --> 00:01:13.512
"Did you hear what I said, Ben?

19
00:01:13.992 --> 00:01:16.873
We think Team Orange is cheating," she repeated.

20
00:01:16.893 --> 00:01:19.774
"As in, breaking the rules so they can win Field Day."

21
00:01:21.995 --> 00:01:24.516
Serena looked back and forth from Winnie to Ben.

22
00:01:27.772 --> 00:01:30.613
"I think he thought you were going to break up with him, Winnie.

23
00:01:31.173 --> 00:01:32.033
Am I right, Ben?"

24
00:01:33.054 --> 00:01:34.694
Blushing, Ben nodded.

25
00:01:34.714 --> 00:01:38.115
"Huh? Why in the world would you think that?"

26
00:01:38.495 --> 00:01:39.215
Winnie asked.

27
00:01:39.235 --> 00:01:43.917
"Because you've been talking to Zork for the past two days," Ben said.

28
00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:45.537
"And you've been ignoring me."

29
00:01:46.537 --> 00:01:48.418
Winnie shook her head in confusion.

30
00:01:48.438 --> 00:01:50.458
"We can talk about that later.

31
00:01:50.939 --> 00:01:53.219
Right now we have to tell you what Serena heard!"

32
00:01:54.059 --> 00:01:55.500
Serena leaned forward.

33
00:01:56.904 --> 00:02:03.227
"I heard a rumor that Zork made some cuts in the rope with his claw during the tug-of-war."

34
00:02:06.848 --> 00:02:09.369
a huge accusation," Ben said.

35
00:02:09.389 --> 00:02:12.451
"You can't accuse someone of cheating based on a rumor.

36
00:02:13.151 --> 00:02:14.411
You need actual proof."

37
00:02:15.372 --> 00:02:18.113
"We have other proof," Serena said.

38
00:02:18.133 --> 00:02:25.056
"Right before Mog's sack ripped, I saw Brunhilda mumbling to herself," Winnie said.

39
00:02:25.636 --> 00:02:28.738
"I'd bet my favorite broomstick that she was casting a spell."

40
00:02:28.758 --> 00:02:34.521
"She was mumbling right before Waldo got itchy too," Serena added.

41
00:02:34.541 --> 00:02:41.885
"And I suspect that she's going to try to use magic in the cross-country race as well."

42
00:02:42.846 --> 00:02:44.567
Ben stared at the two witches.

43
00:02:44.587 --> 00:02:47.768
"Even if this stuff is true, what can we do about it?"

44
00:02:47.788 --> 00:02:49.910
"We can talk to Mr.

45
00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:54.072
Freaky. Maybe he can take a closer look at the rope," Winnie said.

46
00:02:55.116 --> 00:02:59.398
"And we can tell some teachers to watch Team Orange during the final race."

47
00:03:00.178 --> 00:03:01.399
Serena scowled.

48
00:03:01.419 --> 00:03:03.980
"Ugh! I hate cheaters."

49
00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:09.083
"Some of the cross-country race goes through the woods," Ben said.

50
00:03:09.103 --> 00:03:13.044
"It won't be easy to keep an eye on all the runners at the same time."

51
00:03:14.145 --> 00:03:16.366
Anger flashed in Winnie's green eyes.

52
00:03:16.386 --> 00:03:19.427
"I don't think all the runners have to be watched.

53
00:03:19.547 --> 00:03:20.608
Just two of them!"

54
00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:25.321
Ben nodded, and Winnie and Serena hurried off to talk to Mr.

55
00:03:25.381 --> 00:03:31.123
Freaky. Ben returned to his team and told them what the witches had reported.

56
00:03:32.163 --> 00:03:33.324
Waldo shook his head.

57
00:03:33.344 --> 00:03:36.925
"I can't believe Zork and Brunhilda would do that."

58
00:03:36.945 --> 00:03:39.465
"Yeah," Mog said.

59
00:03:39.485 --> 00:03:41.806
"Zork is a really good athlete.

60
00:03:42.266 --> 00:03:43.987
Doesn't he want to win fairly?"

61
00:03:44.007 --> 00:03:47.948
"Field Day is supposed to be fun," Jen said.

62
00:03:48.352 --> 00:03:50.994
"It's not supposed to be all about winning."

63
00:03:52.434 --> 00:03:54.916
Ben looked down, feeling embarrassed.

64
00:03:55.396 --> 00:03:58.738
Like Zork, he'd been thinking a lot about winning today too.

65
00:03:59.218 --> 00:04:00.859
He'd wanted to beat Zork.

66
00:04:00.879 --> 00:04:03.880
"At least I never considered cheating," he thought.

67
00:04:04.741 --> 00:04:07.262
Mr. Gwarg was getting ready to start the race.

68
00:04:07.282 --> 00:04:11.585
"We'll keep an eye on those two as we run," Mog said.

69
00:04:11.605 --> 00:04:13.946
"But we still have to win, you guys.

70
00:04:14.526 --> 00:04:17.488
So remember to keep running, no matter what."

71
00:04:18.508 --> 00:04:19.908
"Or keep floating!"

72
00:04:20.389 --> 00:04:22.109
Pixel said, grinning at Ben.

73
00:04:23.009 --> 00:04:24.330
Deb had been quiet.

74
00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:27.631
"I'd never cheat," she said quietly.

75
00:04:27.651 --> 00:04:30.952
"But I'm going to watch for ways to outsmart them."

76
00:04:31.752 --> 00:04:32.552
Soon Mr.

77
00:04:32.632 --> 00:04:35.293
Gwarg was directing the runners to the starting point.

78
00:04:40.394 --> 00:04:45.696
The race would go around the school and then into the woods before returning to the school grounds

79
00:04:45.856 --> 00:04:46.816
and the finish line.

80
00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:52.283
"Remember to stay on the course," the teacher said.

81
00:04:52.303 --> 00:04:57.407
"Ready set go!"

82
00:04:57.867 --> 00:05:01.830
As Ben zoomed off, he shot a quick look at his teammates.

83
00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:05.893
The best runners on Team Black were Deb and Mog.

84
00:05:06.373 --> 00:05:11.437
Ben could float very fast, but it was going to be a huge challenge for him to beat

85
00:05:11.497 --> 00:05:12.337
Team Orange.

86
00:05:12.978 --> 00:05:15.840
Their runners were already off to a strong start.

87
00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:20.303
Scampering on all fours, Lon had shot to a quick lead.

88
00:05:20.943 --> 00:05:24.165
Gaby's long legs were helping to keep her in second place.

89
00:05:24.966 --> 00:05:30.710
Zork and Mog came next, with Ben, Cleo, Carly, and Deb close behind.

90
00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:35.733
That left Pixel, Waldo, Brunhilda, and Jen bringing up the rear.

91
00:05:37.774 --> 00:05:40.897
The runners circled the school, keeping their positions.

92
00:05:43.078 --> 00:05:45.800
So far Ben hadn't seen any signs of cheating.

93
00:05:46.388 --> 00:05:50.913
"But that could change," he thought, especially once they entered the woods.
